  Consumers: github/babysit-this-pr, github/babysit-my-prs.

  Merge invocation policy: the fragment prints the generic `gh pr merge
  <number>` form and asks the agent to attach the repo-flag idiom
  appropriate to the calling prompt (e.g. `--repo <owner>/<repo>` when
